# The recovery-data run: the rebalanced set plus demonstrations recorded under
# execution noise (chess_recovery_noise), continued from the published policy at a
# tenth of the learning rate - the schedule that left a continuation undamaged
# (docs/EXPERIMENTS.md 4.7). The question is whether data that contains recovery
# from drift does what more clean data did not.
source training/settings.rebalance_lowlr.env
DATASET_ROOT=datasets/lerobot/chess_mc_v3
OUTPUT_DIR=outputs/molmoact2_mc_v4
